Benchmark Dataset of 10 Multi-Feature Models for Single-Setup 3-Axis Milling, version 1
Marius Schmitz, Jan Mertes, Felix Schillinger, Marcel Wagner (RPTU Kaiserslautern-Landau), 2025.
https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.17035762 (zenodo.org/records/17035762), published 2025-09-02.
